  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is devoted to your defense.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Defending Eidolon<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever your eidolon uses this feat, you and your eidolon both gain a +1 dodge bonus to Armor Class. In addition, you can expend one use of your mythic power to negate your eidolon’s penalty on attack rolls and combat maneuver checks caused by using this feat for 1 minute. If your eidolon is aware of an attack and you are not, you still gain this dodge bonus to Armor Class even if you are otherwise denied your Dexterity bonus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc82\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
